1
00:00:00,118 --> 00:00:01,809
Tahun 1932,

2
00:00:01,829 --> 00:00:03,341
tentara Australia berperang

3
00:00:03,361 --> 00:00:04,628
melawan burung.

4
00:00:04,648 --> 00:00:05,464
Dan bisa dibilang,

5
00:00:05,484 --> 00:00:06,817
burungnya yang menang.

6
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,705
Setelah Perang Dunia Pertama,

7
00:00:08,725 --> 00:00:09,773
para veteran diberi lahan

8
00:00:09,793 --> 00:00:11,492
pertanian di Australia Barat.

9
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:13,380
Lalu datang Depresi Besar,

10
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,181
dan harga gandum terus jatuh.

11
00:00:15,201 --> 00:00:16,557
Kemudian sekitar dua puluh

12
00:00:16,577 --> 00:00:18,121
ribu emu bermigrasi ke ladang

13
00:00:18,141 --> 00:00:19,235
mereka.

14
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:20,288
Tanaman dimakan,

15
00:00:20,308 --> 00:00:21,696
pagar dirusak,

16
00:00:21,716 --> 00:00:23,554
dan kelinci ikut masuk lewat

17
00:00:23,574 --> 00:00:24,381
lubangnya.

18
00:00:24,401 --> 00:00:25,821
Para veteran minta senapan

19
00:00:25,841 --> 00:00:26,239
mesin.

20
00:00:26,259 --> 00:00:27,940
Menteri Pertahanan,

21
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,745
George Pearce,

22
00:00:28,765 --> 00:00:29,798
setuju.

23
00:00:29,818 --> 00:00:30,851
Mayor Meredith berangkat

24
00:00:30,871 --> 00:00:32,074
dengan dua senapan Lewis dan

25
00:00:32,094 --> 00:00:33,348
sepuluh ribu butir peluru.

26
00:00:33,368 --> 00:00:34,241
Dua November,

27
00:00:34,261 --> 00:00:35,559
operasi dimulai.

28
00:00:35,579 --> 00:00:37,122
Tapi emu berpencar jadi

29
00:00:37,142 --> 00:00:38,159
kelompok kecil.

30
00:00:38,179 --> 00:00:39,180
Saat seribu lebih emu

31
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,651
mendekat, senapannya macet

32
00:00:40,671 --> 00:00:42,008
setelah dua belas ekor.

33
00:00:42,028 --> 00:00:43,567
Senapan dipasang di truk,

34
00:00:43,587 --> 00:00:45,491
tapi truknya kalah cepat.

35
00:00:45,511 --> 00:00:46,973
Beritanya memalukan,

36
00:00:46,993 --> 00:00:48,783
dan pasukan ditarik.

37
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:50,373
Lalu dikirim lagi.

38
00:00:50,393 --> 00:00:52,704
Sampai sepuluh Desember,

39
00:00:52,724 --> 00:00:55,521
Meredith mengklaim 986 emu

40
00:00:55,541 --> 00:00:58,852
tewas dengan 9.860 peluru.

41
00:00:58,872 --> 00:01:00,710
Tepat sepuluh peluru per ekor,

42
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:01,979
dan angka itu pun diragukan

43
00:01:01,999 --> 00:01:02,754
sejarawan.

44
00:01:02,774 --> 00:01:04,302
Meredith sendiri bilang,

45
00:01:04,322 --> 00:01:05,772
emu menghadapi senapan mesin

46
00:01:05,792 --> 00:01:06,843
seperti tank.

47
00:01:06,863 --> 00:01:08,375
Permintaan bantuan militer

48
00:01:08,395 --> 00:01:09,645
berikutnya ditolak.

49
00:01:09,665 --> 00:01:11,120
Petani beralih ke pagar.

50
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,397
Pelajarannya, masalah alam

51
00:01:12,417 --> 00:01:15,467
jarang selesai dengan senjata.

52
00:01:15,487 --> 00:01:17,699
Kalau kamu petani saat itu,

53
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:19,159
kamu pilih pagar,

54
00:01:19,179 --> 00:01:21,173
atau tetap minta tentara?

